{"type":"text","timestamp":1788351394047,"sessionID":"ses_f9df6b623ffeAF0sWStYNv5qi5","part":{"id":"prt_0620ca9b3001TC5VPeK249YASW","messageID":"msg_0620c8ffc0014SFTLdyVA17h9U","sessionID":"ses_f9df6b623ffeAF0sWStYNv5qi5","type":"text","text":"`design.md` written — 4 tool calls used (2 skills, 1 read, 1 write).\n\nKey fix vs. failed iteration: **two-pass streaming with TILE_D=1024, unroll=1** cuts UB from 328 608 B → ~43 KB, clearing the 253 952 B budget for all 20 cases.\n\nDESIGN_DONE","time":{"start":1788351392179,"end":1788351394046}}}
